{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "附鄒極"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦名道場寺，即\n今潤州興嚴寺是也，由興華嚴故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三十四品八會"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此晉\n經偈"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即六十卷\n晉經全部"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三十九品九會"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或用皂角丸亦可"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "入廁時，先鳴指三下。"}
